00:01:22.524 --> 00:01:24.320
Alright.

00:01:24.980 --> 00:01:27.540
(music continues)

00:01:30.340 --> 00:01:32.290
Oh, that was a bad decision

00:01:32.290 --> 00:01:33.925
but we have to live with it.

00:01:33.925 --> 00:01:35.276
Alright, first of all,

00:01:35.276 --> 00:01:37.440
