00:01:37.440 --> 00:01:40.063
Pumpkin is a shit flavor.

00:01:40.063 --> 00:01:43.575
Pumpkin was a flavor that
was manufactured by Starbucks

00:01:43.575 --> 00:01:46.013
to make people with furry Ugg boots

00:01:46.013 --> 00:01:47.680
shit their yoga pants.

00:01:47.680 --> 00:01:48.724
You know what pumpkin is?

00:01:48.724 --> 00:01:49.734
A vegetable.

00:01:49.734 --> 00:01:52.985
The thing you're all blowing
your leafy loads over

00:01:52.985 --> 00:01:54.715
is (bleep) damn vegetable juice

00:01:54.715 --> 00:01:57.200
with a little bit of
whipped spit on top of it.

00:02:00.470 --> 00:02:02.005
Squash?

00:02:02.005 --> 00:02:03.961
What the (bleep) is a squash?

00:02:03.961 --> 00:02:04.670
All I know is

00:02:04.670 --> 00:02:06.734
pumpkin tastes like if you put cinnamon

00:02:06.734 --> 00:02:08.025
