00:02:08.025 --> 00:02:11.705
Pumpkin is just, like,
nature's genital wart.

00:02:11.705 --> 00:02:12.413
Okay?

00:02:12.413 --> 00:02:15.385
We all deal with it,
we all deal with them.

00:02:17.475 --> 00:02:20.820
Next, everybody's just
insufferable during fall.

00:02:20.820 --> 00:02:23.336
"Oh you wanna go watch
the trees change color?"

00:02:23.336 --> 00:02:24.357
That's what they say.

00:02:24.357 --> 00:02:26.318
"You wanna go look at all the colorful

00:02:26.318 --> 00:02:28.895
"folia-- flow-- floliage-- foliage?"

00:02:28.895 --> 00:02:29.854
That's what I say.

00:02:29.854 --> 00:02:31.476
"You wanna go sit by the fire

00:02:31.476 --> 00:02:33.388
