of a tractor with hay

00:02:39.527 --> 00:02:42.329
"driven by a guy in a
flannel shirt named Burl?"

00:02:42.329 --> 00:02:43.513
Enough.

00:02:43.513 --> 00:02:45.137
E-nough.

00:02:45.137 --> 00:02:48.241
Why don't you and your
chunky Ralph Lauren scarf

00:02:48.241 --> 00:02:50.251
