00:02:50.251 --> 00:02:52.731
Go jump into a lake.

00:02:52.731 --> 00:02:53.868
That's what I say.

00:02:53.868 --> 00:02:54.847
Next!

00:02:54.847 --> 00:02:55.981
Squirrels.

00:02:55.981 --> 00:02:58.942
Okay, the squirrels are
angriest in the fall

00:02:58.942 --> 00:03:01.212
