00:03:09.017 --> 00:03:09.924
Yes, they do.

00:03:09.924 --> 00:03:11.561
Squirrels love pastries.

00:03:14.240 --> 00:03:15.529
As a matter of fact,

00:03:15.529 --> 00:03:18.577
November 17th, 2012!

00:03:18.577 --> 00:03:21.689
I baked myself a tray
of delicious, warm, soft

00:03:21.689 --> 00:03:23.975
Pillsbury sugar-cookies.

00:03:23.975 --> 00:03:26.228
Baked them all by myself, I did.

00:03:26.228 --> 00:03:28.885
I set them down on the table to cool off

00:03:28.885 --> 00:03:30.835
