00:03:32.022 --> 00:03:33.043
A massacre.

00:03:33.043 --> 00:03:34.785
Crumbs everywhere.

00:03:34.785 --> 00:03:35.842
All over the floor.

00:03:35.842 --> 00:03:37.359
All over the table.

00:03:37.359 --> 00:03:39.405
All over the ground, my cookies were.

00:03:39.405 --> 00:03:40.903
Exhibit B!

00:03:40.903 --> 00:03:43.872
This mother (bleep)
sitting outside my window,

00:03:43.872 --> 00:03:47.382
