(bleep) beady little eyes.

00:03:47.382 --> 00:03:49.343
He knows.

00:03:49.343 --> 00:03:51.190
He knows what he's doing.

00:03:51.190 --> 00:03:52.572
Not believin' me yet?

00:03:52.572 --> 00:03:54.777
You don't believe this squirrel did it?

00:03:54.777 --> 00:03:56.784
Exhibit C!

00:03:56.784 --> 00:03:57.829
One week later,

00:03:57.829 --> 00:04:00.487
