00:04:16.641 --> 00:04:17.819
No.

00:04:17.819 --> 00:04:19.412
It's a fall squirrel.

00:04:19.412 --> 00:04:21.017
They're (bleep) monsters.

00:04:21.017 --> 00:04:23.437
Next, everyone want to go apple picking.

00:04:23.437 --> 00:04:24.121
Why?

00:04:24.121 --> 00:04:25.282
WHY?

00:04:25.282 --> 00:04:28.672
You want me to pay $40 to
drive to a (bleep) orchard

00:04:28.672 --> 00:04:31.695
