00:05:00.616 --> 00:05:02.831
You know what's a better
pie than apple pie?

00:05:02.831 --> 00:05:04.302
Any (bleep) pie.

00:05:04.302 --> 00:05:06.810
Any other pie is better than apple pie.

00:05:06.810 --> 00:05:07.973
And finally,

00:05:07.973 --> 00:05:10.650
